<title>USA: Krantor signs calamari contract.</title>
<headline>Krantor signs calamari contract.</headline>
<dateline>DEER PARK, N.Y. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krantor Corp said on Tuesday it signed a five-year exclusive agreement with a Chinese trading company to distribute frozen squid in the United States.</p>
<p>The Chinese partner, whose name the company refused to release, will finance the purchase and sale of frozen squid, the company said. Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Krantor said it expects this joint venture to make it the leading provider of frozen squid in the United States and help bring the company back to profitability by the end of this fiscal year.</p>
</text>
